Login Test Cases
Test Case	          Test Scenario	                                                                    Result
TC01	   Log in using a registered email and correct password.	     Login is successful, and the user is redirected to the main page.
TC02	   Log in using an incorrect email or password.	                 Login is unsuccessful, and an error message appears.
TC03	   Log in using a pending, blocked, or disapproved account.	     Login is unsuccessful, and a message explains why the account cannot access the system.
Main Page Test Cases
TC04	  Check if the main page opens after logging in.	                Main page loads successfully, and the dashboard is displayed.
TC05	  Check the navigation menu on the main page.	                    Navigation menu displays the available system modules.
TC06	  Check the summary cards on the dashboard.	                        Dashboard successfully displays the available customer, product, employee, and sales information.
TC07	  Check the welcome section on the main page.	                    Welcome section successfully displays the user's name, role, and current date.
TC08	  Check if users can access the modules assigned to their accounts.	Users can successfully view and access only the modules allowed for their accounts.
